Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Constructing Transcendental Basis", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.995013899407686*^9, 
  3.995013908346779*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2216a499-0891-cd49-829e-\
b77a540627a7"],

Cell["\<\
Weight-one basis:
LChiP=Log[\[Chi] \[Chi]b] -----even-parity
LChiM=Log[\[Chi]/\[Chi]b]  -----odd-parity
LOneP=Log[(\[Chi]-1) (\[Chi]b-1)]  ------even-parity
LOneM=Log[(\[Chi]-1)/(\[Chi]b-1)]  ------odd-parity

Weight-two dilogarithm basis:
Li2P=PolyLog[2,\[Chi]]+PolyLog[2,\[Chi]b] ----even-parity
Li2M=PolyLog[2,\[Chi]]-PolyLog[2,\[Chi]b] -----odd-parity\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.995020822507349*^9, 
  3.995020919824213*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4d66b46d-2186-024a-8275-\
d4af72202f03"],

